                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f407bf39-4bc7-4be6-9536-5d980867a4dc",
                        "entry_id": "7cccdd8a-8d3f-37db-af88-a61ab191d653",
                        "tags": [
                            "past"
                        ],
                        "form": "incubated"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bdb848ba-e3a2-3ba7-a23a-59781ddc9ebd",
                        "entry_id": "7cccdd8a-8d3f-37db-af88-a61ab191d653",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To brood, raise, or maintain eggs, organisms, or living tissue through the provision of ideal environmental conditions."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "177171c6-bd94-43fa-b725-89778bbc3a67",
                                "sense_id": "bdb848ba-e3a2-3ba7-a23a-59781ddc9ebd",
                                "text": "The places where the birds are nesting are interesting spots to visit. Both parents incubate and the scene is animated as the birds fly about in all directions."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "821e962c-e388-405e-a6aa-da65cd154968",
                                "sense_id": "bdb848ba-e3a2-3ba7-a23a-59781ddc9ebd",
                                "text": "Part of our problem in praying for our children, he suggested, is the time lage, the necessary slow maturation of our prayers. But that's the way of God's rhythm in nature. For instance, the hen must patiently sit on her eggs to incubate them before the baby chicks hatch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3502b56f-0edf-495c-aed0-e720bed034dc",
                                "sense_id": "bdb848ba-e3a2-3ba7-a23a-59781ddc9ebd",
                                "text": "The mother dead these fourteen years did incubate in her own bosom the creature who would carry her off."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a77fc33b-98ce-43d1-ac8e-92cc248c15d9",
                                "sense_id": "bdb848ba-e3a2-3ba7-a23a-59781ddc9ebd",
                                "text": "The female cichlid fish are called \"mouth breeders,\" which means they incubate eggs in their mouth."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7245a85-9d83-30eb-8c0d-b3e266f0b405",
                        "entry_id": "7cccdd8a-8d3f-37db-af88-a61ab191d653",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To incubate metaphorically; to ponder an idea slowly and deliberately as if in preparation for hatching it."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively",
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2dd64fc6-52ac-4440-956c-4984f2298478",
                                "sense_id": "c7245a85-9d83-30eb-8c0d-b3e266f0b405",
                                "text": "It was a habit he developed, of incubating and maturing his thought upon a subject, and of then rushing into the type-writer with it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "67706da0-8df0-4570-8b34-e79899702e74",
                                "sense_id": "c7245a85-9d83-30eb-8c0d-b3e266f0b405",
                                "text": "When you've got your theme–let the concept incubate. Walk around with it, sleep on it."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ec71f8df-450f-4164-9052-994c24c09ed9",
                        "source_entry_id": "7cccdd8a-8d3f-37db-af88-a61ab191d653",
                        "source_sense_description": "brood, raise, or maintain eggs, organisms, or living tissue",
                        "target_lang_word": "incuber",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "incuber",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1514b650-4392-3c1b-8282-998757afc343",
                                        "entry_id": "d3656d70-dc22-3c59-99ab-b3005ee128f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Opérer l’incubation de."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7a0fadb-563f-4d64-bc54-99875eed6125",
                                                "sense_id": "1514b650-4392-3c1b-8282-998757afc343",
                                                "text": "Sur un poisson du lac de Tibériade, le chromis paterfamilias, qui incube ses œufs dans la cavité buccale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c6ef7b0b-b7ec-3d2a-a0d5-b4a50c2d228e",
                                        "entry_id": "d3656d70-dc22-3c59-99ab-b3005ee128f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mener à terme ses œufs dans le corps même, en parlant d’insectes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6503e05-c47c-4b5c-9673-375a185dbb91",
                                                "sense_id": "c6ef7b0b-b7ec-3d2a-a0d5-b4a50c2d228e",
                                                "text": "Dans l’espace de douze à quatorze jours, la femelle [du doryphore] s’accouple, incube et dépose ses œufs, au nombre de dix à douze sur la partie inférieure des fanes de la pomme de terre."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "597b80a8-fb7d-336a-83f5-2fd652e298e6",
                                        "entry_id": "d3656d70-dc22-3c59-99ab-b3005ee128f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Soutenir un projet en accueillant la personne qui le porte et en lui apportant du conseil au sein d’un incubateur."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e64af7c-cd5e-478d-8200-55ca6b172743",
                                                "sense_id": "597b80a8-fb7d-336a-83f5-2fd652e298e6",
                                                "text": "Yvelines : une idée ? Faites-la incuber !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "46d66934-d33f-456f-84ab-e196a5d9b891",
                                                "sense_id": "597b80a8-fb7d-336a-83f5-2fd652e298e6",
                                                "text": "Une fois rentré en France j’ai lancé une association, puis en 2007 j’ai quitté GE, celle d’après j’ai incubé mon projet chez PlaNET Finance, et l’année suivante je créais MicroDON, entreprise de l’économie sociale et solidaire dédiée à ce qu’on appelle la générosité embarquée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f8d59f62-efab-32bc-a5ee-d512070162a7",
                                        "entry_id": "d3656d70-dc22-3c59-99ab-b3005ee128f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Accueillir et soutenir une personne qui a un projet de création d’entreprise."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a34affc-da07-4827-83f1-90120bcd5653",
                                                "sense_id": "f8d59f62-efab-32bc-a5ee-d512070162a7",
                                                "text": "Je suis incubé, depuis maintenant depuis 1 mois. Après des débuts compliqués, on a trouvé notre rythme de croisière avec mon chargé d’affaires."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
